{"name": "Guilded Fools", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guilded Fools</strong> is a dark-comedy incremental game set inside a twisted stage play. Gather a cast of foolish heroes, customize their gear, channel eldritch powers and win over the crowd for a chance to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LET THE SHOW BEGIN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smite enemies directly with high-damage cursor attacks, or sit back and let your party carry you to victory.\u00a0Use a variety of combat potions to change the course of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/787d5596cb1e92eeadb91ce78f15f0cb.poster.avif?t=1793985995\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/787d5596cb1e92eeadb91ce78f15f0cb.webm?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/787d5596cb1e92eeadb91ce78f15f0cb.mp4?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER A BRANCHING SKILL TREE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an extensive skill tree. Unlock new heroes, unleash powerful perks, and maximize your party's potential.\u00a0Upgrade the cursor area to curse enemies, buff allies and unleash extra effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/33f3a91898e27d738a3f8f6662afdc6e.poster.avif?t=1793985995\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/33f3a91898e27d738a3f8f6662afdc6e.webm?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/33f3a91898e27d738a3f8f6662afdc6e.mp4?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPGRADE YOUR FOOLISH HEROES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend currency on a varied cast of helpful characters. Empower your 6-hero party with stronger abilities and high-tier equipment.\u00a0Upgrade your camp's crew to unlock passive upgrades and extra utility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/6eb9e647bb9eab28274201e5d74c3ab1.poster.avif?t=1793985995\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/6eb9e647bb9eab28274201e5d74c3ab1.webm?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/6eb9e647bb9eab28274201e5d74c3ab1.mp4?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BANISH POWERFUL BOSSES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through 10 atmospheric acts, each guarded by a powerful and unique final boss.\u00a0Defeat bosses to gather unique gear and unlock new camp features through rescued crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/b864c77f57dc138a257431d2c97ed7f0.poster.avif?t=1793985995\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/b864c77f57dc138a257431d2c97ed7f0.webm?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/b864c77f57dc138a257431d2c97ed7f0.mp4?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COLLECT UNIQUE EQUIPMENT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slay enemies to loot powerful equipment. Discover over 100 unique items, stack game-changing perks, and experiment with varied party compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/db09c88f76e44eca60749fcf37e772ee.poster.avif?t=1793985995\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/db09c88f76e44eca60749fcf37e772ee.webm?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/extras/db09c88f76e44eca60749fcf37e772ee.mp4?t=1793985995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Guilded Fools is a dark-comedy incremental game set inside a twisted stage play. Gather a cast of foolish heroes, customize their gear, channel eldritch powers and win over the crowd for a chance to escape.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5203950/8cd4e5a4c2afb797b2adf926b5492f4042158aa5/header.jpg?t=1793985995", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Indie", "Incremental", "Strategy", "Idler", "Dark Comedy"], "developers": "toyari", "publishers": "toyari", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5203950", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/-7WkeN